WEBVTT

00:00:10.835 --> 00:00:15.865
On that cold night, I came to realize

00:00:15.865 --> 00:00:20.845
that there's a place deeper down
that hurts even more than injuries

00:00:20.845 --> 00:00:26.075
In this world painted with lies

00:00:26.075 --> 00:00:30.685
where it's not clear what's true anymore

00:00:30.685 --> 00:00:33.585
I wanted to keep you safe

00:00:33.585 --> 00:00:40.725
The moment that
distortion and love overlapped,

00:00:40.725 --> 00:00:48.805
the wind embraced the
sadness that had closed in

00:00:48.805 --> 00:01:00.115
I'll never forget your sole voice
that continues to echo through the sky

00:01:00.115 --> 00:01:08.955
The prayer is going to melt
away and disappear, just like snow

00:01:08.955 --> 00:01:13.595
Today, I'll increase my speed again

00:01:13.595 --> 00:01:17.695
as I search for the reason for living

00:01:17.695 --> 00:01:29.095
even if I can't be a hero just yet

00:01:32.275 --> 00:01:36.285
Amalgam has left secured
area and continues to escape.

00:01:36.285 --> 00:01:39.815
At present, Amanda is conducting solo pursuit.

00:01:39.815 --> 00:01:43.425
Call her back! What can one mech possibly do?!

00:01:43.425 --> 00:01:46.825
The Apocalypse Knights
are still locked in battle

00:01:46.825 --> 00:01:49.265
with enemy interceptors above Point J-64!

00:01:49.265 --> 00:01:52.625
Tactics Al recommends
dispatching reinforcements!

00:01:55.135 --> 00:02:00.945
No! We can't send our garrison until
all blocks have been confirmed safe!

00:02:00.945 --> 00:02:05.445
Commander! Amanda isn't
responding to the order to return to base!

00:02:05.445 --> 00:02:10.615
Amanda Werner! I cannot allow
solo action! Return to base immediately!

00:02:10.615 --> 00:02:14.455
That Amalgam is Hermann!
He still has control over his mind!

00:02:14.455 --> 00:02:15.855
What?!

00:02:15.855 --> 00:02:18.255
If I go alone, Hermann will calm down and...

00:02:18.255 --> 00:02:22.565
There is no guarantee of that!
Have you forgotten Wolf's betrayal?!

00:02:22.565 --> 00:02:24.635
He's still alive!

00:02:24.635 --> 00:02:25.595
Wolf is?!

00:02:25.595 --> 00:02:28.835
Hermann intends to meet up with Wolf.

00:02:28.835 --> 00:02:32.335
Hermann's escape route is in
the direction of Zeppelin Air Base,

00:02:32.335 --> 00:02:34.675
which is currently occupied by Wolf!

00:02:34.675 --> 00:02:36.205
That's just coincidence!

00:02:36.205 --> 00:02:40.975
Amanda! Follow orders!
Let the Apocalypse Knights handle...

00:02:44.255 --> 00:02:46.115
Damn you, Amanda...

00:03:11.745 --> 00:03:13.235
Mei-Fong! Left!

00:03:14.515 --> 00:03:16.175
They're too close!

00:03:20.025 --> 00:03:22.185
They're just simple jets, too!

00:03:23.325 --> 00:03:24.595
Gotcha!

00:03:24.595 --> 00:03:26.495
New one at 12 o'clock!

00:03:31.095 --> 00:03:34.665
Damn! We're getting nowhere!
If we don't do something!

00:03:34.665 --> 00:03:38.905
Mei-Fong! Go higher! We're going
to escape past their maximum altitude!

00:03:38.905 --> 00:03:40.565
Roger!

00:03:41.245 --> 00:03:43.005
Oh, no, you don't!

00:03:46.445 --> 00:03:48.105
Xargin...

00:03:50.055 --> 00:03:53.215
My sister is alive...

00:03:57.895 --> 00:04:01.725
If this is your idea of
revenge, then it's futile...

00:04:05.495 --> 00:04:08.665
You, if anyone, should understand...

00:04:12.405 --> 00:04:17.035
...just how much pain you're causing her now...

00:04:19.075 --> 00:04:22.515
Isn't that right, Xargin?

00:04:26.615 --> 00:04:32.185
But, if you still insist on saddening her...

00:04:33.765 --> 00:04:38.255
...then I don't care what form I take anymore...

00:04:44.605 --> 00:04:47.005
When that time comes, Xargin...

00:04:53.585 --> 00:04:57.815
...I'll stop you with my own two hands!

00:04:59.155 --> 00:05:04.355
I'm sorry to interrupt, Commander.

00:05:04.355 --> 00:05:06.495
What do you want at a time like this?

00:05:06.495 --> 00:05:09.865
Have a look at the lab's readings.

00:05:09.865 --> 00:05:12.695
You'll see something most intriguing.

00:05:17.035 --> 00:05:20.695
Impossible! Their mobility
hasn't dropped at all!

00:05:21.905 --> 00:05:26.715
Damn. I guess common sense
goes out the window for Amalgams.

00:05:26.715 --> 00:05:27.845
Mei-Fong.

00:05:27.845 --> 00:05:31.515
How far until we're within air
burst firing range of the air base?

00:05:31.515 --> 00:05:37.855
We need to get 30,000, no, at
least 27,000 closer to hit it for sure.

00:05:37.855 --> 00:05:43.365
All right. Mei-Fong, separate
the Bow-rider and Sword-rider.

00:05:43.365 --> 00:05:46.195
The Scale-rider will
switch to high-mobility mode.

00:05:46.195 --> 00:05:49.465
We'll hold off the enemy while we freefall.

00:05:49.465 --> 00:05:52.605
Use that opening to rush
into air burst firing range

00:05:52.605 --> 00:05:55.875
and blast the target with everything you have.

00:05:55.875 --> 00:05:57.015
Can you do it?

00:05:57.015 --> 00:05:59.345
That's crazy!

00:05:59.345 --> 00:06:02.315
Diving without parachutes, huh...

00:06:02.315 --> 00:06:07.955
It's insane, but it's definitely
the only option we have left now.

00:06:07.955 --> 00:06:11.855
We only need to recombine
before we crash into the ground.

00:06:11.855 --> 00:06:15.365
The Scale-rider's speed is our only hope.

00:06:15.365 --> 00:06:18.195
Understood. I'll give it a try.

00:06:21.265 --> 00:06:22.825
What are they...?!

00:06:33.915 --> 00:06:36.215
Damn you!

00:06:36.215 --> 00:06:39.205
Your fight is with me!

00:06:40.325 --> 00:06:41.985
Impudent little!

00:06:49.795 --> 00:06:52.495
Xargin!

00:07:01.975 --> 00:07:03.635
Xargin!

00:07:05.815 --> 00:07:07.475
I'm!

00:07:14.625 --> 00:07:16.715
Beautiful, isn't it?

00:07:18.195 --> 00:07:20.565
The experiment is a success.

00:07:20.565 --> 00:07:25.935
Modify the GARM with spare
Triple-Six parts immediately. Hurry!

00:07:50.855 --> 00:07:55.995
I know thy works, and thy toil and patience,

00:07:55.995 --> 00:07:58.835
and that thou canst not bear evil men,

00:07:58.835 --> 00:08:02.965
and didst try them that call
themselves apostles, and they are not,

00:08:02.965 --> 00:08:05.565
and didst find them false.

00:08:06.905 --> 00:08:10.935
But I have this against thee,

00:08:13.245 --> 00:08:16.485
that thou didst leave thy first love.

00:08:16.485 --> 00:08:20.555
Remember therefore whence thou art fallen,

00:08:20.555 --> 00:08:23.185
and repent and do the first works;

00:08:23.185 --> 00:08:31.525
or else I come to thee, and will
move thy candlestick out of its place.

00:08:34.065 --> 00:08:35.965
Not good!

00:08:35.965 --> 00:08:37.625
Here goes!

00:08:47.385 --> 00:08:50.615
Shoot them down! Don't
let even one get through!

00:09:07.105 --> 00:09:09.695
A sniper attack?! Where is it coming from?!

00:09:27.555 --> 00:09:29.215
What?!

00:09:51.675 --> 00:09:53.575
- Mei-Fong!
- I'm on it!

00:10:03.055 --> 00:10:04.715
So long!

00:10:05.555 --> 00:10:07.215
Damn you!

00:10:13.965 --> 00:10:15.565
Looks like we did it!

00:10:15.565 --> 00:10:21.045
No, not yet. We've staved off the
enemy, but we didn't wipe them out.

00:10:21.045 --> 00:10:23.645
Should we turn back and take out the rest?

00:10:23.645 --> 00:10:26.115
Two units have suffered intense damage.

00:10:26.115 --> 00:10:28.175
It would be dangerous to continue fighting.

00:10:29.485 --> 00:10:34.575
I guess the fact we bought time
for us to regroup is good enough.

00:11:37.885 --> 00:11:39.545
Hermann?

00:11:41.185 --> 00:11:43.285
Forget about me.

00:11:45.725 --> 00:11:47.385
Hermann...

00:11:50.465 --> 00:11:51.395
Is it you, Hermann?!

00:11:51.395 --> 00:11:53.055
He's dead.

00:11:54.365 --> 00:11:57.165
I'm not Hermann anymore.

00:11:59.835 --> 00:12:01.865
Don't come any closer!

00:12:02.905 --> 00:12:08.715
Just forget about me... Just leave me alone.

00:12:08.715 --> 00:12:12.255
You want me to abandon
you because you're infected?

00:12:12.255 --> 00:12:17.325
Because you're an Amalgam?
Because you're an inhuman monster now?!

00:12:17.325 --> 00:12:21.465
Could you have said that to Brad?!

00:12:21.465 --> 00:12:24.765
Is that how you thought of Al?!

00:12:24.765 --> 00:12:26.425
I!

00:12:27.905 --> 00:12:29.565
Stay away!

00:12:31.175 --> 00:12:33.735
Answer me, Hermann!

00:12:33.735 --> 00:12:39.575
Do you think Al and Brad both died as monsters?!

00:12:39.575 --> 00:12:42.245
They were both XAT members to the very end!

00:12:42.245 --> 00:12:47.055
They lived and died as
members of XAT! Isn't that right?!

00:12:47.055 --> 00:12:49.745
Don't be so stupid!

00:12:52.755 --> 00:12:55.365
You...

00:12:55.365 --> 00:13:02.435
You, more than anyone,
should know how I feel now!

00:13:02.435 --> 00:13:06.075
I don't want to lose anyone else...

00:13:06.075 --> 00:13:08.705
I won't abandon you, no matter what happens!

00:13:08.705 --> 00:13:13.745
Amalgam or not, you're still Hermann!

00:13:13.745 --> 00:13:16.445
Don't lose your heart, too!

00:13:20.015 --> 00:13:23.145
I'm sorry, Amanda...

00:13:29.295 --> 00:13:30.955
Hermann...

00:13:34.305 --> 00:13:37.295
I'm... afraid...

00:13:39.975 --> 00:13:42.105
Back then...

00:13:42.105 --> 00:13:45.615
When I changed and went berserk...

00:13:45.615 --> 00:13:50.915
I... I had no control over myself at all...

00:13:50.915 --> 00:13:56.485
In fact, it felt exactly like
I'd become an inhuman beast,

00:13:56.485 --> 00:14:01.495
destroying everything around
me for no apparent reason...

00:14:01.495 --> 00:14:08.555
And then afterward... I realized what I did...

00:14:11.105 --> 00:14:15.245
That's why I'm afraid, Amanda...

00:14:15.245 --> 00:14:18.745
I'm scared I could hurt you sometime too!

00:14:18.745 --> 00:14:21.715
And if that happens, I'll!

00:14:35.695 --> 00:14:37.025
Amanda...

00:14:37.025 --> 00:14:38.395
Hermann.

00:14:38.395 --> 00:14:40.705
I'll have faith in you to the very end.

00:14:40.705 --> 00:14:45.075
Just as you had faith in Gerd Frentzen!

00:14:45.075 --> 00:14:48.645
You believed in him to the very end, didn't you?

00:14:48.645 --> 00:14:50.445
What do you think about him now?

00:14:50.445 --> 00:14:55.985
Do you regret how you felt then?
Do you think you were a fool?

00:14:55.985 --> 00:14:58.685
Have you realized that Gerd was a monster

00:14:58.685 --> 00:15:01.945
now that you're an Amalgam yourself?

00:15:04.395 --> 00:15:07.685
I-It's not like that!

00:15:09.195 --> 00:15:11.435
Gerd was...

00:15:11.435 --> 00:15:14.135
Gerd was Gerd to the very end!

00:15:14.135 --> 00:15:20.075
Then believe in yourself like you
believed in the champ back then!

00:15:20.075 --> 00:15:24.515
Abandoning yourself now would
be the same as abandoning Gerd!

00:15:24.515 --> 00:15:31.715
Gerd and Al and Brad all desperately
fought until their final moments!

00:15:31.715 --> 00:15:34.455
None of them gave up!

00:15:34.455 --> 00:15:39.725
What did they fight for,
then?! What did they die for?!

00:15:39.725 --> 00:15:42.025
Answer me, Hermann!

00:15:43.765 --> 00:15:46.035
Go... Hermann...

00:15:46.035 --> 00:15:49.125
Go! Forget about us!

00:15:57.145 --> 00:15:59.315
Hermann?

00:15:59.315 --> 00:16:04.015
I forgot the most important thing.

00:16:04.015 --> 00:16:08.225
I'm a member of XAT to the
very end, no matter what happens.

00:16:08.225 --> 00:16:13.925
I owe it to Al and Brad
to at least stand by that.

00:16:20.065 --> 00:16:25.235
I don't know how long
this body will stay together,

00:16:25.235 --> 00:16:30.605
but even so, there's something
I have to do before I kick the bucket.

00:16:33.545 --> 00:16:36.385
It's actually not that bad.

00:16:36.385 --> 00:16:40.115
I'm going to defeat Wolf with this body!

00:16:40.115 --> 00:16:43.155
You know where Wolf is?!

00:16:43.155 --> 00:16:47.495
No. But I can sense his presence.

00:16:47.495 --> 00:16:50.765
It might be another ability
I have now that I'm an Amalgam.

00:16:50.765 --> 00:16:52.285
I'm coming with you.

00:16:53.795 --> 00:16:58.205
It'll be XAT that brings him down for good!

00:17:00.875 --> 00:17:02.535
Yeah.

00:17:04.615 --> 00:17:09.845
Thanks. With us teamed up,
there's nothing to fear!

00:17:22.195 --> 00:17:24.965
We've lost quite a large number.

00:17:24.965 --> 00:17:28.605
But the bomb only destroyed
the aboveground facilities.

00:17:28.605 --> 00:17:33.305
Thanks to their retreat,
I've been able to replenish our forces.

00:17:34.205 --> 00:17:36.345
We're still good to go.

00:17:36.345 --> 00:17:39.145
I wouldn't underestimate Zwolf if I were you.

00:17:39.145 --> 00:17:41.735
Their next attack will come very soon.

00:17:42.845 --> 00:17:46.085
Carelessness will prove fatal.

00:17:46.085 --> 00:17:54.995
Even so, I still need to
prove my strength to you and him.

00:17:55.725 --> 00:18:00.465
I'll tear them apart.
The fight is just getting started.

00:18:03.065 --> 00:18:06.505
Replenishment and part
replacement for all units nearly complete.

00:18:06.505 --> 00:18:08.675
We will remobilize in the next five minutes

00:18:08.675 --> 00:18:11.445
and immediately recommence
our attack on Zeppelin Air Base.

00:18:11.445 --> 00:18:18.015
No, according to surveillance
satellites, the enemy is regrouping too.

00:18:18.015 --> 00:18:22.955
We'll need to act carefully.
Wait until the new member is ready.

00:18:22.955 --> 00:18:24.495
New member?

00:18:24.495 --> 00:18:29.225
The Blassreiter enhancement
system just achieved completion.

00:18:29.225 --> 00:18:35.335
This is the perfect opportunity for
a live test, so I'm sending your brother.

00:18:35.335 --> 00:18:36.635
You're sending Joseph?!

00:18:36.635 --> 00:18:40.675
The theft of the Triple-Six
was a serious blunder on our part,

00:18:40.675 --> 00:18:45.745
but a modified GARM is undergoing
final adjustments to replace it.

00:18:45.745 --> 00:18:49.785
Hold on! There's still too much
we don't know about that system!

00:18:49.785 --> 00:18:54.525
It's too dangerous to activate! We
need to inspect the data in more detail!

00:18:54.525 --> 00:19:00.855
Yes. But the truth of the matter
is that you're struggling in this fight.

00:19:00.855 --> 00:19:04.935
An Amalgam of unknown type has also appeared.

00:19:04.935 --> 00:19:07.925
This is a very worrying situation.

00:19:09.205 --> 00:19:13.275
For now, let the Apocalypse
Knights continue with the operation.

00:19:13.275 --> 00:19:16.805
If it looks like three
units really isn't enough,

00:19:16.805 --> 00:19:19.865
then you can do whatever you deem is best.

00:19:22.645 --> 00:19:24.385
Very well.

00:19:24.385 --> 00:19:28.785
This is your chance to show
us what you're really made of.

00:19:31.555 --> 00:19:35.795
Scale-rider, preparations complete.
Ready to leave at any time.

00:19:35.795 --> 00:19:37.995
All set here, too.

00:19:37.995 --> 00:19:40.595
What will you do, Sasha?

00:19:42.765 --> 00:19:45.875
Let's go. There's no turning back now.

00:19:45.875 --> 00:19:49.745
Let's put an end to them once and for all.

00:19:49.745 --> 00:19:52.045
Apocalypse Knights, launch!

00:20:01.285 --> 00:20:05.345
Bring it on, Zwolf. It's time to end this fight!

00:20:06.825 --> 00:20:09.895
Swarm of enemy Demoniac fighters from the fore!

00:20:09.895 --> 00:20:13.355
- Mei-Fong! Rise sharply and lure the enemy!
- Roger!

00:20:24.915 --> 00:20:28.145
Thanks for grouping up in a
nice little package, bad guys.

00:20:28.145 --> 00:20:31.885
You may be agile, but you're lacking in smarts.

00:20:31.885 --> 00:20:35.085
Okay, Mei-Fong! Undock us!

00:20:35.085 --> 00:20:36.745
Roger!

00:20:50.905 --> 00:20:51.975
It's started!

00:20:51.975 --> 00:20:53.665
Let's hurry, Amanda!

00:20:59.515 --> 00:21:01.175
Mei-Fong!

00:21:21.965 --> 00:21:25.005
I'm going to end this, Wolf!

00:21:25.005 --> 00:21:29.375
This poison you spread will be what kills you!

00:21:54.095 --> 00:22:05.215
I dreamed of that day we chased shooting stars

00:22:05.215 --> 00:22:15.625
What we had kept safe disappeared like sand

00:22:15.625 --> 00:22:19.695
Just another illusion

00:22:19.695 --> 00:22:28.795
Asleep, inside memories

00:22:30.035 --> 00:22:32.335
Wish for the stars

00:22:32.335 --> 00:22:40.875
Holding countless wishes with both hands

00:22:40.875 --> 00:22:43.445
A wish for the stars

00:22:43.445 --> 00:22:51.395
Quietly by your side, as you sleep

00:22:51.395 --> 00:22:57.025
Yes, right next to you

00:22:57.025 --> 00:23:03.005
Holding countless wishes

00:23:03.005 --> 00:23:08.765
Yes, right beside you

00:23:12.045 --> 00:23:16.585
The bloody nightmare awakens a forbidden power.

00:23:16.585 --> 00:23:22.855
Who can stand up to this beast?
Who can argue, and battle, with it?

00:23:22.855 --> 00:23:27.325
Episode 18: "The Fourth Apocalypse."

00:23:27.325 --> 00:23:32.285
Those who kill with the
sword will also die by the sword.
